title: Helmepponye_intro
location: ballroom
---

Wow, it’s the end of the year already and HQ is throwing a grand old party! Just look at those decorations! Everyone is dressed to the nines, too! You are as well - you look good, if you don’t say so yourself. The best part is that your outfit seems to have a pocket that could just about fit anything and not ruin your look. Perfect for carrying around that gift you got for -insert character chosen for gift hunt-! Vegapunk really does make some incredible things. 
You glance at the clock, remembering your goal from a whole year ago. When it chimes midnight, you hope you have someone interested in kissing those lips of yours. Or holding your hand. Or liking you at all, really.
Well, no way to go but forward. Though it couldn’t hurt to say hello to some familiar faces at the party, could it?
-Pick character- //HOW DO??
You wander through the party, picking up a drink and greeting those you’ve come to know over the past year as you keep an eye out for Helmeppo.
Finally, you spot him, talking to a couple Marines you don’t know. Unlike some of the others, he looks entirely at home in his, er, pretty loud suit. You wouldn’t have picked it for him, but he looks confident.
The other two excuse themselves. Helmeppo watches them go, sipping from his drink, then sees you coming over and smiles over the rim of his cup.
Helmeppo: {$name}, good to see you.
{$name}: You too. I’ve actually been looking for you.
Helmeppo: You’re that bored, huh?
-> Very funny.
    Helmeppo: That’s me. Ringing in the new year with stellar comedy.
-> If you want me to leave…
    He studies you, trying to figure out if you’re serious or not, then bursts out laughing.
    Helmeppo: I guess I asked for that.
-> What? No!
    Grinning, he shakes his head.
    Helmeppo: Nevermind. 
With a tilt of his head, he invites you to step over toward the wall, where it’s a little quieter.
Gift time?
-> Give gift
    <<jump helmepponye_reject>> <<jump helmepponye_friend>> <<jump helmepponye_best>> <<jump helmepponye_ultra>> //HOW DO??
-> Don't give gift
    <<jump helmepponye_wrong>>
===

title: helmepponye_reject
location: ballroom
---

This is your chance. The present is burning a hole in your pocket. As Helmeppo starts making small talk about the dressy clothes the other Marines are wearing, you summon up your resolve. It’s now or never.
{$name}: So, Helmeppo? I wanted to … Uh… Here. This is for you.
You pull your gift out and hold it out to him in both hands. 
Helmeppo looks from the item to you. It takes a moment for understanding to dawn in his expression. His voice is abruptly stiff and formal.
Helmeppo: Oh. {$name}, this is very flattering, but I think you might have misread something. I can’t accept your gift. But I hope you enjoy the party.
He excuses himself, leaving you standing there with the gift still in your hands and midnight fast approaching.
<<jump helmepponye_other>> //HOW DO?? as in this goes to other characters able to confess, or to ending.
===

