    Helmeppo: Hey! This is really thoughtful, {$name}. Thank you.
Helmeppo: You’re the second friend ever to buy me a gift. I’m still not used to it.
{$name}: I was actually hoping we could be more than friends?
He looks blankly at you. 
Helmeppo: Sorry, {$name}. I don’t feel like that. Um… Do you want this back?
{$name}: No! It’s a gift, not a bribe. Happy New Year.
You walk quickly away before your disappointment reaches your face.
