You fish in your pocket and pull the gift out. 
{$name}: This is for you.
He looks quizzically at you, then peeks into the present. One eyebrow raises.
Helmeppo: Are you *sure* this is for me?
{$name}: …
Helmeppo: …
{$name}: Ahhh, you’re right. 
{$name}: Sorry, can I have it back?
He hands it back with a smile.
Helmeppo: Sure. Good luck on your mission.
You hurry off, looking for the right person.
